:RF-03
    a
        :FunctionalRequirement ,
        :Requirement ,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-03" ;
    :definedInArtifact :RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    :requirementIdentifier "RF-03" ;
    :requirementStatement "The system must detect changes in the agent's context, including movement, loss of connectivity, zone changes, changes in the proximity of nodes and transitions between urban, rural or restricted areas." ;
    :tracedToMechanism
        :M-CTX-01 ,
        :M-MODEL-04 ;
    :tracedToPolicy :P-ZONE-04 ;
.

:RF-04
    a
        :FunctionalRequirement ,
        :Requirement ,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-04" ;
    :definedInArtifact :RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    :requirementIdentifier "RF-04" ;
    :requirementStatement "The system must monitor device state: battery, connectivity, active sensors, availability of parameterized data and local preprocessing capacity." ;
    :tracedToMechanism
        :M-DATA-02 ,
        :M-TX-01 ;
    :tracedToPolicy :P-DATA-04 ;
.

:RF-05
    a
        :FunctionalRequirement ,
        :Requirement ,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-05" ;
    :definedInArtifact :RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    :requirementIdentifier "RF-05" ;
    :requirementStatement "The system must record the operational state of continuum nodes, including availability, load, communication, residual capacity, resource usage, request queues and operating status. `ComputeOnly` or `Inoperative` states must be explicitly detected so that orchestration can decide whether to delegate, isolate or exclude the node." ;
    :tracedToMechanism
        :M-NODE-01 ,
        :M-NODE-02 ;
    :tracedToPolicy :P-NODE-01 ;
.

:RF-10
    a
        :FunctionalRequirement ,
        :Requirement ,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-10" ;
    :definedInArtifact :RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    :requirementIdentifier "RF-10" ;
    :requirementStatement "The system must distinguish between raw physiological observations and transmissible parameterized data. For these requirements, the local scope is limited to the mobile/wearable device and, when policy permits, the associated Mist tier; raw physiological observations must not be transmitted to Edge, Fog or Cloud." ;
    :tracedToMechanism
        :M-DATA-01 ,
        :M-TX-01 ;
    :tracedToPolicy :P-DATA-01 ;
.

:RF-14
    a
        :FunctionalRequirement ,
        :Requirement ,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-14" ;
    :definedInArtifact :RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    :requirementIdentifier "RF-14" ;
    :requirementStatement "The system must evaluate prediction quality and separately record prediction confidence, estimated error, local feedback and the observed quality of the model used. Weights used for multicriteria selection must not substitute for observed quality metrics." ;
    :tracedToMechanism
        :M-AUD-01 ,
        :M-METRIC-01 ;
    :tracedToPolicy :P-MODEL-08 ;
.

:RF-24
    a
        :FunctionalRequirement ,
        :Requirement ,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-24" ;
    :definedInArtifact :RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    :requirementIdentifier "RF-24" ;
    :requirementStatement "The system must version models, record their update dates and support rollback to previous versions in the event of degradation, errors or policy non-compliance." ;
    :tracedToMechanism
        :M-MODEL-05 ,
        :M-VAL-04 ;
    :tracedToPolicy :P-FL-08 ;
.

:RF-29
    a
        :FunctionalRequirement ,
        :Requirement ,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-29" ;
    :definedInArtifact :RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    :requirementIdentifier "RF-29" ;
