    :definedInArtifact :PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01 ;
    :hasPolicyStatement "Semantic representation and querying must use open standards compatible with RDF/OWL/Turtle and SPARQL 1.1. An applicable standard vocabulary, including SOSA/SSN, SAREF, FOAF or GeoSPARQL, must be reused or aligned with; any conceptual duplication must be documented and justified." ;
